<title>USA: SkyWest December load factor rises.</title>
<headline>SkyWest December load factor rises.</headline>
<dateline>ST. GEORGE, Utah 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>SkyWest Airlines Inc said on Monday that its December load factor increased 1.5 points to 50.6 percent from 49.1 percent in December 1995.</p>
<p>Load factor for the year increased 3.3 points to 51.3 percent from 48.0 percent in 1995, Skywest said.</p>
<p>Passengers boarded, revenue seat miles and available seat miles have increased in December and 1996 from the comparable periods in 1995.</p>
</text>
